  "description": "The CLASH RIDE focuses on simplicity and reliability so that the rider can focus on the pure pleasure of riding.\n• The ROCKSHOX Zeb fork with 38mm stanchions provides the precision needed to hold the line. Its DebonAir + spring and Rush RC hydraulic cartridge are ideal for adapting the behaviour of the fork. The Super Deluxe Select shock absorber has a wide adjustment range as well as a new anti-bottoming out pad which increases life expectancy. This suspension provides comfort and performance on all types of terrain.\n• Braking comes in the form of the SRAM DB8s. Powerful and modular, they are perfectly suited to the CLASH.\n• E13 LG1 DH wheels have a wide and reinforced profile that provides comfort when landing jumps and Grip on slopes.\n• A SRAM SX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain with 11-50t gearing will be able to overcome all obstacles.",
